{"seq":3,"slug":"sensitive-data-discovery-at-scale","title":"规模化敏感数据发现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/data-privacy-engineering/pii-identification-and-classification/sensitive-data-discovery-at-scale","wordCount":2344,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"规模化敏感数据发现\">规模化敏感数据发现</h1><p>一家中型 SaaS 公司在 2026 年做合规盘点时，常见的真实数字是：几十个 S3 桶、上百张数据库表、数千个 SaaS 协作文档，外加几年沉淀下来的 Slack 导出和工单附件。GDPR 第 30 条要求维护处理活动记录，可没人能手工告诉你&quot;客户的护照号到底散落在哪几处&quot;。规模化敏感数据发现要解决的就是这个落差——不是判断&quot;这一行字符串是不是 PII&quot;，而是在 PB 级、跨结构化与非结构化、且每天还在增长的数据资产里，持续地把敏感数据找出来、分好类、定好位。这与单条文本的 PII 识别是两个量级的问题：算法本身只是配菜，扫描架构、采样策略、增量调度和误报治理才是主菜。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>把&quot;在一个文本字段里检测 PII&quot;放大到&quot;在整个企业数据湖里持续发现敏感数据&quot;，会冒出三类全新难题。第一是覆盖面：数据既有 Postgres 这样的结构化源，也有 PDF、图片、Markdown 这类非结构化内容——BigID 在 2026 年甚至专门把 DSPM 扩展到了 AI 编程工具生成的 Markdown 指令文件，因为那里也开始藏密钥和客户数据（<a href=\"https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/bigid-extends-dspm-to-markdown-files-closing-a-critical-data-security-gap-in-the-age-of-vibe-coding-302757640.html\">BigID PRNewswire, 2026</a>）。第二是成本：全量逐字节扫描在 PB 级别既慢又贵，必须靠采样和聚类压缩工作量。第三是时效：数据每天在变，一次性快照很快过期，所以 2026 年的主流方案（BigID、Securiti 等 DSPM 平台）都强调&quot;持续可见性&quot;而非&quot;时间点快照&quot;（<a href=\"https://bigid.com/blog/what-is-dspm/\">BigID DSPM, 2026</a>）。</p>\n<p>下图描述一条典型的规模化发现流水线，从数据源接入到生成数据目录与风险地图。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[数据源接入&lt;br/&gt;S3 / 数据库 / SaaS / 文件系统] --&gt; B[资产编目&lt;br/&gt;枚举表 / 桶 / 文档]&#10;  B --&gt; C[聚类与采样&lt;br/&gt;相似资产分组 + 抽样]&#10;  C --&gt; D[多层分类引擎&lt;br/&gt;正则 + 校验 + NER + 语义]&#10;  D --&gt; E[置信度打分与上下文增强]&#10;  E --&gt; F{超过阈值?}&#10;  F --&gt;|是| G[写入数据目录&lt;br/&gt;标注类别 / 位置 / 拥有者]&#10;  F --&gt;|否| H[标为待复核 / 丢弃]&#10;  G --&gt; I[风险地图 + 合规报告&lt;br/&gt;RoPA / DSPM 仪表盘]&#10;  I --&gt; J[增量重扫&lt;br/&gt;监听变更 -&gt; 回到 C]\">flowchart TD\n  A[数据源接入&lt;br/&gt;S3 / 数据库 / SaaS / 文件系统] --&gt; B[资产编目&lt;br/&gt;枚举表 / 桶 / 文档]\n  B --&gt; C[聚类与采样&lt;br/&gt;相似资产分组 + 抽样]\n  C --&gt; D[多层分类引擎&lt;br/&gt;正则 + 校验 + NER + 语义]\n  D --&gt; E[置信度打分与上下文增强]\n  E --&gt; F{超过阈值?}\n  F --&gt;|是| G[写入数据目录&lt;br/&gt;标注类别 / 位置 / 拥有者]\n  F --&gt;|否| H[标为待复核 / 丢弃]\n  G --&gt; I[风险地图 + 合规报告&lt;br/&gt;RoPA / DSPM 仪表盘]\n  I --&gt; J[增量重扫&lt;br/&gt;监听变更 -&gt; 回到 C]</pre><p>发现引擎背后是若干技术路线的组合，各有取舍。下表对比四类常见检测方法在规模化场景下的表现。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>检测方法</th>\n<th>精确率倾向</th>\n<th>召回率倾向</th>\n<th>算力成本</th>\n<th>典型适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>正则 + 校验和</td>\n<td>中（结构化标识误报多）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>信用卡号、身份证号、邮箱</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关键词 / 字典</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>表头、字段名提示</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NER 模型</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>人名、地址、机构名</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LLM 语义分类</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>上下文相关、改写变体、间接标识</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>没有单一方法能赢家通吃：正则对信用卡号几乎零成本但对&quot;任意 16 位数字&quot;会狂误报；LLM 能理解&quot;我女儿的就诊记录&quot;这种语义，但每千 token 的推理成本让全量直扫不现实。所以工程上的核心是分层与级联——先用便宜手段过滤，再把不确定样本交给昂贵模型。</p>\n<h2 id=\"采样与聚类-把-pb-压成-gb\">采样与聚类：把 PB 压成 GB</h2><p>全量扫描在企业规模下基本不可行，业界的共识是先聚类再抽样。其逻辑是：结构化数据的 schema 一致性意味着同一张表的列在语义上高度同质——如果对 <code>users.email</code> 这一列抽样 1000 行都判定为邮箱，那么整列几乎可以确定就是邮箱，不必扫完十亿行（<a href=\"https://www.varonis.com/blog/data-classification-deep-dive\">Varonis, 2026</a>）。对非结构化数据，做法是先用机器学习把相似文件聚成簇，再从每个簇里抽小样本分类，用簇的结论代表整簇。</p>\n<p>采样误差可以量化。设某列共 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 行，敏感值的真实占比为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>，抽样 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 行，样本占比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{p}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的标准误约为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mi>n</mi></mfrac></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">SE(\\hat{p}) = \\sqrt{\\frac{p(1-p)}{n}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.44em;vertical-align:-0.7356em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.7044em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-4.4em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6644em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:2.48em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"2.48em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 2592\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M424,2478\nc-1.3,-0.7,-38.5,-172,-111.5,-514c-73,-342,-109.8,-513.3,-110.5,-514\nc0,-2,-10.7,14.3,-32,49c-4.7,7.3,-9.8,15.7,-15.5,25c-5.7,9.3,-9.8,16,-12.5,20\ns-5,7,-5,7c-4,-3.3,-8.3,-7.7,-13,-13s-13,-13,-13,-13s76,-122,76,-122s77,-121,77,-121\ns209,968,209,968c0,-2,84.7,-361.7,254,-1079c169.3,-717.3,254.7,-1077.7,256,-1081\nl0 -0c4,-6.7,10,-10,18,-10 H400000\nv40H1014.6\ns-87.3,378.7,-272.6,1166c-185.3,787.3,-279.3,1182.3,-282,1185\nc-2,6,-10,9,-24,9\nc-8,0,-12,-0.7,-12,-2z M1001 80\nh400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7356em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n = 1000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p = 0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>E</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.0158</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">SE \\approx 0.0158</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.0158</span></span></span></span></span>，即 95% 置信区间宽度不到正负 3.1 个百分点。这意味着对&quot;整列是否含敏感数据&quot;这种二元判断，千级采样已绰绰有余，而扫描成本相比全量下降了几个数量级。Grab 工程团队在其 LLM 数据分类实践里也采用&quot;先少量人工标注、再用模型放大模式&quot;的路线（<a href=\"https://engineering.grab.com/llm-powered-data-classification\">Grab Engineering</a>）。</p>\n<p>采样的代价是会漏掉低频敏感值——如果一列里只有万分之一的行混入了身份证号，千级采样很可能完全错过。因此实务上对高风险源（如自由文本备注字段）会调高采样率甚至全扫，对低风险源才激进采样。这是一个用召回率换吞吐的旋钮，必须按数据源的风险分级来拧。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分层级联-从正则到-llm\">分层级联：从正则到 LLM</h2><p>2026 年成熟的发现引擎几乎都是多层级联，而非单一模型。一个典型管线是这样工作的：先用正则匹配出候选片段（如 16 位连续数字），紧接着用校验和（信用卡走 Luhn 算法）剔除明显的伪命中，再让 NER 模型补上正则覆盖不到的人名、地址，最后把那些上下文模糊、改写变体多的疑难样本交给 LLM 做语义裁决。</p>\n<p>Microsoft Presidio 这套开源框架就是分层的活样本：它先用正则匹配器找出候选实体，再用基于 NLP 的 NER 模型自主检测，可能时用校验和验证；最终给每个命中一个 0 到 1 的置信分，分值越高越确定（<a href=\"https://github.com/microsoft/presidio\">Presidio GitHub</a>、<a href=\"https://microsoft.github.io/presidio/evaluation/\">Presidio 评估文档</a>）。它的上下文增强机制很值得借鉴：当一个 16 位数字附近出现 &quot;credit&quot; 这样的词，原始置信分会被上调，但最终值封顶在 1.0。</p>\n<p>为什么级联能省钱？设总数据量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span>，第一层正则的过滤率（保留比例）为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，第二层 NER 的过滤率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则真正进入 LLM 的数据量约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D \\cdot f_1 \\cdot f_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.05</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_1 = 0.05</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.05</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_2 = 0.3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.3</span></span></span></span></span>，则只有约 1.5% 的数据触达最贵的那一层，整体 LLM 推理成本相比全量直扫降低近 70 倍。这正是级联架构的经济学本质——把昂贵算力留给真正需要语义判断的少数样本。</p>\n<p>下面是一段简化的级联打分逻辑，展示置信分如何随上下文叠加。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def classify_span(span, context_window):&#10;    score = 0.0&#10;    if REGEX_CARD.match(span):&#10;        score = 0.6                      # 正则基线置信&#10;        if luhn_valid(span):&#10;            score = 0.85                 # 校验和通过，提升&#10;    elif ner_model.is_person(span):&#10;        score = max(score, 0.55)         # NER 命中&#10;    # 上下文增强：附近出现领域提示词&#10;    if any(kw in context_window for kw in (&quot;信用卡&quot;, &quot;card&quot;, &quot;卡号&quot;)):&#10;        score = min(score + 0.2, 1.0)    # 封顶 1.0&#10;    if 0.4 &lt; score &lt; 0.7:                # 灰区交给 LLM 复核&#10;        score = llm_adjudicate(span, context_window)&#10;    return score\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> classify_span</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(span, context_window):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> REGEX_CARD</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.match(span):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.6</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                      # 正则基线置信</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> luhn_valid(span):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.85</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                 # 校验和通过，提升</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    elif</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ner_model.is_person(span):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(score, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.55</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)         </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># NER 命中</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 上下文增强：附近出现领域提示词</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(kw </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> context_window </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> kw </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"信用卡\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"card\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"卡号\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)    </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 封顶 1.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.4</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.7</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:                </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 灰区交给 LLM 复核</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> llm_adjudicate(span, context_window)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> score</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"误报治理与持续运行\">误报治理与持续运行</h2><p>规模化发现真正的运维痛点不是漏报而是误报洪水。正则在评估中&quot;会产生过多误报&quot;几乎是行业共识（<a href=\"https://www.varonis.com/blog/data-classification-deep-dive\">Varonis, 2026</a>）——一个把所有 9 位数字都标成社保号的扫描器，会在第一周就淹没合规团队，进而被关掉。治理误报的常用手段有三层：校验和（结构化标识符天然带冗余校验位）、上下文窗口（看字段名和邻近文本）、以及反馈闭环（把人工复核结果喂回去调阈值或微调模型）。</p>\n<p>衡量一次发现运行的质量，标准的精确率-召回率框架直接适用。设真正例 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">TP</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span>、假正例 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">FP</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span>、假负例 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">FN</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Precision</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>F</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>Recall</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>F</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Precision} = \\frac{TP}{TP + FP}, \\quad \\text{Recall} = \\frac{TP}{TP + FN}, \\quad F_1 = \\frac{2 \\cdot P \\cdot R}{P + R}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Precision</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1297em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Recall</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1297em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1297em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>合规场景下召回往往比精确更重要——漏掉一处未受保护的 PII 可能直接触发监管罚款，而多报几个误命中只是浪费一点复核工时。所以阈值通常会调得偏向高召回，再用人工或二次 LLM 复核把误报压下去。</p>\n<p>持续运行是 2026 方案与早期工具的分水岭。现代 DSPM 平台靠监听变更事件做增量重扫，而非定期全量，从而在数据新增、迁移、复制时近实时更新风险地图（<a href=\"https://bigid.com/blog/what-is-dspm/\">BigID DSPM, 2026</a>）。下表对比一次性扫描与持续发现两种运行模式。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>一次性快照</th>\n<th>持续发现</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>触发方式</td>\n<td>手动 / 定时全量</td>\n<td>变更事件驱动 + 增量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结果时效</td>\n<td>很快过期</td>\n<td>近实时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>算力分布</td>\n<td>周期性峰值</td>\n<td>平滑分摊</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合规价值</td>\n<td>审计时点证据</td>\n<td>持续 RoPA / 风险监控</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型代表</td>\n<td>早期 DLP 脚本</td>\n<td>BigID / Securiti / Amazon Macie</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>工程上，增量发现需要为每个资产维护&quot;上次扫描指纹&quot;（如对象的 ETag、表的最大更新时间戳），只对发生变化的部分重跑级联管线，把发现从一项偶尔的体检变成一条常驻的数据流水线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>规模化敏感数据发现把单条 PII 识别放大成一个系统工程问题，关键认知如下：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>算法不是瓶颈，架构才是——正则、NER、LLM 各有取舍，工程价值在于如何把它们级联起来分摊成本。</li>\n<li>采样与聚类把 PB 级压成可处理量；千级采样对&quot;整列是否含敏感数据&quot;的二元判断已足够，标准误约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.016</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.016</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.016</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>分层级联让昂贵的 LLM 只处理约百分之一二的疑难样本，整体推理成本可降低数十倍。</li>\n<li>置信度打分加上下文增强（如 Presidio 的 0–1 评分机制）是平衡精确与召回的核心旋钮。</li>\n<li>误报治理（校验和 + 上下文 + 反馈闭环）决定工具能否被合规团队长期使用，而非用一周就被弃。</li>\n<li>2026 的分水岭是持续发现：变更驱动的增量重扫取代一次性快照，输出近实时的 RoPA 与风险地图。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>参考来源：<a href=\"https://www.varonis.com/blog/data-classification-deep-dive\">Varonis 数据分类深度解析</a>、<a href=\"https://github.com/microsoft/presidio\">Microsoft Presidio</a>、<a href=\"https://bigid.com/blog/what-is-dspm/\">BigID DSPM 2026 指南</a>、<a href=\"https://engineering.grab.com/llm-powered-data-classification\">Grab LLM 数据分类工程实践</a>、<a href=\"https://netwrix.com/en/resources/blog/pii-discovery-tools/\">Netwrix PII 发现工具 2026</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"规模化敏感数据发现","id":"规模化敏感数据发现"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"采样与聚类：把 PB 压成 GB","id":"采样与聚类-把-pb-压成-gb"},{"level":2,"text":"分层级联：从正则到 LLM","id":"分层级联-从正则到-llm"},{"level":2,"text":"误报治理与持续运行","id":"误报治理与持续运行"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"数据分类与盘点","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/data-privacy-engineering/pii-identification-and-classification/data-classification-and-inventory"},"next":{"title":"匿名化与假名化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/data-privacy-engineering/deidentification-and-pets/anonymization-and-pseudonymization"}}